[For "black"]
[Kind "sideline"]
[Start "giuoco-main 1...e5"]
[Name "The Bishop's Opening: 2.Bc4 Nc6 3.Nf3"]

2. Bc4 { The Bishop's Opening. The bishop looks at f7 before anything else has moved. [%cal Gc4f7] }
2... Nc6 { The same move again. It guards e5, so White's queen has nothing to hit if it comes out. }
3. Nf3 { The most common move, and this is the Italian Game by another order. After 3...Bc5 you are at home. } *
